:: MP Temple Schism More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
旧书桌抽屉里多了一册用废账纸反折糊成的副页，记着仪式之间没人肯署名的琐事。当前归属<<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>净火戒律<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>慈悲圣所<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "concord">>钟律调和<<else>>尚未落定<</if>>，仪轨 <<print $mpTempleRites>> 格，恩典 <<print $mpGrace>>，雾潮水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。管副页的老修士把新调争执、仪式筹备与告解丑闻归在前三页，回廊封锁、津贴削减与雾潮净化归在后三页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Temple Schism Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
