:: MP Temple Post Reform 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpTempleSchismInit>>
<<if $mpWorldTempleSchismLocked>>
教务司的红蜡早已落定，这一卷案卷只在首次落印时改过殿内称谓与作息，此后不再改动。
<<elseif $mpTemplePChoice is "fail">>
<<set $mpGrace to Math.max(-100, ($mpGrace or 0) - 4)>><<set $mpTempleRites to Math.max(0, ($mpTempleRites or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpTempleNextStageDay to Time.days + 2>>守旧修士堵在回廊门口不肯交出钥匙并退回了你的仪轨石子，本轮改制受挫，需隔日再议。
<<else>>
<<set $mpWorldTempleSchismLocked to 1>><<set $mpTempleNpcTitleMode to "reform_relief">><<set $mpTempleNpcScheduleMode to "day_clinic_open_night">><<mpTempleAlign "reform">><<set $mpWorldPriceMod to Math.max(85, ($mpWorldPriceMod or 100) - 2)>>
